NEW_CLRN_CLCD^신규청산구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="339" _ulen="277" >

CFD_ODER_AMT^CFD주문금액^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_FEE^CFD수수료^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_MARG^CFD증거금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_TRTX^CFD거래세^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_RLOV_INT^CFD롤오버이자^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_BRNG_FEE^CFD차입수수료^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_CLRN_PRLS^CFD청산손익^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
